                    "message": "@chaul@amperecomputing.com - I am okay with the changes made from PLDM file numeric sensor perspective - whether exposing the size of a file via metric/file_size segment path is acceptable or not should be debated via PDI(as that would be a common understanding across companies) - lets get it added to the PDI, then we can merge this change."
